      "size": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Description\n\nEverything sampling-related is inside the one node. Connect a model, a VAE, a prompt and a picture, and it hands back the finished image.\n\nThe picture is enlarged/refined, then repainted one tile at a time. Only one tile\nis on the graphics card at once, so memory is set by `tile_size`, not by the size of the finished picture.\n\nRepoint the four loaders at your own files before running.\n\nSharpening without enlarging: set `scale_factor` to 1.0, unplug upscale_model, and use refine_strength around 0.90.\n\nFull details: docs/nodes/Y7Nodes_Flux2KleinUpscaler.md"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Description\n\nEverything sampling-related is inside the one node. Connect a model, a VAE, a prompt and a picture, and it hands back the finished image.\n\nThe picture is enlarged/refined, then repainted one tile at a time. Only one tile\nis on the graphics card at once, so memory is set by `tile_size`, not by the size of the finished picture.\n\nRepoint the four loaders at your own files before running.\n\nSharpening without enlarging: set `scale_factor` to 1.0, unplug upscale_model, and use refine_strength around 0.90.\n\nFull details: docs/nodes/Y7Nodes_Flux2KleinUpscaler.md"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
