      "title": "Prompt",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Keep this short and about the picture as a whole, or leave it empty.\n\nThe same prompt goes to every tile, so naming a specific object (\"a red bicycle\") tries to put it in all of them. \"sharp, detailed photograph\" is the kind of thing that works the best.\n\nThe negative is zeroed out because Klein runs at cfg 1.0 and ignores it. Replace it with a real prompt only if you raise cfg above 1.0."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Keep this short and about the picture as a whole, or leave it empty.\n\nThe same prompt goes to every tile, so naming a specific object (\"a red bicycle\") tries to put it in all of them. \"sharp, detailed photograph\" is the kind of thing that works the best.\n\nThe negative is zeroed out because Klein runs at cfg 1.0 and ignores it. Replace it with a real prompt only if you raise cfg above 1.0."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
